=== Feed Changer & Remover ===Contributors: goback2,mohammadgh,saeedbeygi,mehrban,vahedimohammadreza2013Tags: feed , rss , feed changer , rss changer , rss protector ,rss feed,remove feed,remove rss, feed protector , فیدو , تغییر دهنده فید,فیدRequires at least: 3.0Tested up to: 6.5.3Stable tag: 0.3License: GPLv2 or laterLicense URI: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html	Feed Changer== Description ==Do you want to disable your site's feed?Don't want to disable the address of the feed, but only want to access it yourself?This plugin is for you!Disable your site's feed with just one tick.Or put a password on your feed so that only you can use it.= Features =* Change main feed/rss/atom URL* Disable main feed/rss/atom * get new url many as many you want!This plugin is licensed under the [Apache License, Version 2.0](http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).	== Changelog === 0.1 =* ver 0.1 released.